.TH P3M 7 "@DATE@" "p3m @VERSION@" "p3m Manual"
.SH NAME
p3m \- Parallel POSIX Permission Manager: parallel file system tools
.SH DESCRIPTION
p3m is a suite of command line tools for Linux that parallelise traditionally
single-threaded file system operations across large directory trees.
Standard tools such as
.B "chmod \-R"
walk the tree and issue system calls from one thread; on trees with many
files, especially on network or high-latency storage, wall-clock time is
dominated by serialised metadata operations.
The p3m tools keep many operations in flight using a pool of worker threads.
.SH TOOLS
.TP
.BR p3m\-ls (1)
Recursive directory lister with CSV output at three detail levels.
.TP
.BR p3m\-ch (1)
chmod, chown and chgrp in a single scan.
.TP
.BR p3m\-rm (1)
Recursive remove with glob masks and a hard root guard.
.TP
.BR p3m\-du (1)
Disk usage with GNU du-compatible options.
.TP
.BR p3m\-cp (1)
Recursive copy.
.TP
.BR p3m\-mv (1)
Move, with a rename fast path and tree merging.
.TP
.BR p3m\-find (1)
find with the classic expression grammar (read-only).
.TP
.BR p3m\-diff (1)
Directory comparison with optional byte-exact content verification.
.TP
.BR p3m\-stats (1)
Age and hot/cold statistics from a
.B "p3m\-ls \-m full"
catalogue.
.SH CONVENTIONS
.IP \(bu 2
Tools that modify the file system are
.B dry runs
by default and take
.B \-\-apply
to make changes.
.IP \(bu 2
Output is CSV (RFC\ 4180 quoting), written to standard output or to a file with
.BR \-o .
.B \-o
and
.B \-q
enable a live progress display on a terminal; a summary is always printed to
standard error.
.IP \(bu 2
.B \-j
sets the worker thread count (default: the number of online CPUs).
.IP \(bu 2
Symbolic links are never followed.
.IP \(bu 2
Exit status:
.B 0
success,
.B 1
completed with errors,
.B 2
usage error.
.BR p3m\-cp " and " p3m\-mv
additionally exit 130 or 143 when interrupted by SIGINT or SIGTERM after
finishing their in-flight transfers.
.IP \(bu 2
The suite is versioned as a whole:
.B \-\-version
on any tool prints the same release number.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/p3m/
README, CHANGELOG and per-tool documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR p3m\-ls (1),
.BR p3m\-ch (1),
.BR p3m\-rm (1),
.BR p3m\-du (1),
.BR p3m\-cp (1),
.BR p3m\-mv (1),
.BR p3m\-find (1),
.BR p3m\-diff (1),
.BR p3m\-stats (1)
